<main id="main-content" class="main-shell">
  <section class="about-card reveal-up">
    <p class="eyebrow">About This Memorial</p>
    <h1>Who Is Java?</h1>
    <p>
      Java was my real cat, with strong opinions about snacks, naps, and
      chewing absolutely everything in sight.
    </p>
    <p>
      He had pica, so many entries are about the eternal struggle to keep socks,
      cardboard, and charging cables out of reach.
    </p>
    <p>
      This subsite preserves his memory with hardcoded stories and images,
      separate from the main site for future cat adventures.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every page under <code>/java</code> is dedicated to Java's archive.
    </p>

    <div class="about-highlights">
      <article>
        <h2>What's preserved</h2>
        <p>Java's posts, moods, and memories are kept as static data that stays with the project.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>Media archive</h2>
        <p>Photos are served from <code>public/images/java</code> and tied to posts in the Java data files.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>Site split</h2>
        <p>The main site now has its own look and future path, while Java's section remains unchanged in spirit.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

